{"seq":33,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:45:42.655Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"69ca8824408895d6a323687bbd952d8e730b45172b464f301ee4a10f082db7c8","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Bettina, the official handoff date is 3-Nov-2025. Moss's Coastal digest of 2-Nov-2025 says ownership changes hands \"tomorrow\", and your own Pellucid cutover recap (8-Dec-2025) also gives November 3 as the official handoff. Your recap adds that you kept running PHL day to day until 21-Nov-2025 for the terminal cutover, and Kwame fully took over on 22-Nov-2025. If the tracker wants the official change of ownership, use 3-Nov-2025. If it wants when Kwame actually took over day to day, use 22-Nov-2025.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000130","thread_ts":"1792159200.000129"}}
